WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.251 --> 00:00:02.700
- Kumail, how do we know each other?

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.890
- Well, we met at Comic Con

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:07.560
when we were both announced,

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:08.910
I was announced to be in Eternals

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.210
and you were announced to Shang-Chi.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.090
- [Simu-Liu] Yes.

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:12.600
- That was the first time we met.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.810
- [Simu-Liu] Yes. I only
asked to take a photo

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:17.640
with two people that night
and it was you and Emily.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:18.473
- Oh really?

00:00:18.473 --> 00:00:20.130
- I literally- Yeah, yeah, oh my God.

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:21.741
- Because we're approachable.

00:00:21.741 --> 00:00:22.970
(audience laughing)

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:24.380
You're not gonna go up to Chris Evans

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:25.590
he's gonna slap you down.

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:27.160
- [Simu-Liu] Probably yeah.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.883
Hemsworth too, would just crush me,

00:00:28.883 --> 00:00:30.523
with a single bicep.

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:33.440
But no, it was such an incredible night.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.180
I mean, there was a dinner, I don't know-

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.860
Would you, were you at the dinner?

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:38.290
There was a thing, you know, we went out,

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:41.270
you know first of all, on
stage, Hall H Comic Con,

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:42.600
which is amazing.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:43.560
- It's amazing.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:45.430
It was the first time I'd been able to get

00:00:45.430 --> 00:00:48.610
into Hall H and it was on stage.

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:49.670
- [Simu-Liu] Incredible.
- Yeah.

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:51.400
- [Simu-Liu] And then
we wind up like in this,

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.050
in this room with Kevin Figi

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:56.320
and like literally everyone
in the, in the MCU.

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:57.153
- [Kumail] Yeah.

00:00:57.153 --> 00:00:58.260
- Who's table were you sitting at?

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:00.530
- So we sat next to Scott Derrickson

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:01.930
who directed Dr. Strange.

00:01:01.930 --> 00:01:02.996
- [Simu-Liu] Oh, nice.

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:03.829
- It was him and his kids,

00:01:03.829 --> 00:01:05.550
and we talked about movies and
TV shows, had a great time.

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:06.530
Who did you sit with?

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:09.096
- I, you know, Angelina Julie,

00:01:09.096 --> 00:01:11.230
(audience cheering)

00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:14.170
the, so what happened was
I was, I was actually-

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:15.880
- What happened was,
- what had happened was-

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.630
- I sat there like a creep.

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:19.830
Is this one taken?

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:20.860
- And now look at us.

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:22.872
We made the movies, the movies are out.

00:01:22.872 --> 00:01:25.400
(crowd cheering)

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:26.950
I think, I think they
made a pile of money.

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:28.350
I think they say we saved cinema.

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:29.463
Although maybe we just kept it warm.

00:01:29.463 --> 00:01:32.120
- Yeah I got a big
plaque, AMC sent it to me.

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:34.440
That was like, thank
you specifically Kumail.

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:35.273
- [Simu-Liu] Right.

00:01:35.273 --> 00:01:37.010
- My kids can eat because of you.

00:01:37.010 --> 00:01:38.460
- [Simu-Liu] That's amazing, did they-

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:41.830
They got me one too, but
then they asked for it back.

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:43.200
Because scratched out my name.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.033
Yeah, yeah.

00:01:44.033 --> 00:01:47.510
- It did say, I saw the S and
the L and I was like good.

00:01:47.510 --> 00:01:48.680
Took it from Simu-Liu

00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:50.580
- And then I think, I
think Spider-Man maybe,

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:52.050
maybe took it from both
of us. I don't know.

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:52.883
- [Kumail] I'm in hiding.

00:01:52.883 --> 00:01:55.110
I'm not giving the trophy up.

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:57.550
Tom can pry from a cold dead hands.

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:58.383
(audience laughing)

